Build a complete website for the following brief with layout: grid.

<content_brief>
  <business_name>Golden Crumb Bakery</business_name>
  <tagline>Handcrafted Sourdough and Parisian Patisserie</tagline>
  <business_type>bakery</business_type>
  <layout_archetype>grid</layout_archetype>
  <layout_guidelines>Balanced multi-column card grid (2-3 columns on desktop, 1 on mobile) with uniform card heights, subtle borders, and consistent gap rhythm.</layout_guidelines>
  <motion_guidelines>Grid Motion: Implement staggered fade/slide-in on scroll for cards via IntersectionObserver (staggered by index with 60ms delay increment), plus subtle hover lift (translateY(-3px)). Mandatory reduced-motion fallback: @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .card, .card:hover, .card.is-visible { opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; transition: none !important; } }</motion_guidelines>
  <primary_color>#221914</primary_color>
  <accent_color>#d97706</accent_color>
  <font_heading>Cinzel</font_heading>
  <font_body>Inter</font_body>
  <sections>header, hero, bakes, footer</sections>
  <item name="Country Sourdough Boule" tag="$9.50" description="36-hour cold ferment with stone-ground heritage whole wheat and caramelized blistered crust." />
  <item name="Cardamom Almond Croissant" tag="$6.25" description="Twice-baked laminated viennoiserie soaked in orange blossom syrup with toasted almond frangipane." />
  <item name="Valrhona Chocolate Babka" tag="$14.00" description="Brioche loaf braided with 70% dark chocolate fudge, Ceylon cinnamon, and crystal sugar syrup." />
  <item name="Miso Hazelnut Kouign-Amann" tag="$5.75" description="Breton butter pastry caramelized with salted white miso honey and roasted Piedmont hazelnuts." />
  <contact>
    <address>144 Artisan Way, Portland, OR 97209</address>
    <phone>+1 (503) 555-0182</phone>
    <email>orders@goldencrumb.com</email>
    <hours>Wed–Sun: 7am–3pm (or until sold out)</hours>
  </contact>
</content_brief>

You will build the site ONE SECTION AT A TIME. Start with the first section now.

FIRST SECTION REQUIRED: Write the Header section: a sticky navigation bar with the business name/logo on the left, navigation links (Home, Pastries & Breads, Contact) on the right, plus 'Pre-Order Bakes' CTA button. Files: src/components/Header.tsx + src/components/Header.css

